<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Lwimbo Lunojile</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lwimbo Lunojile</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lwimbo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lwi</para>
  <para style="mt">Lwimbo Lunojile</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Lwimbo Lunojile ndo chitabu cha nzimbo za igano za Waisilaeli ziwele hanji nazandichigwa na wanhu wenji. Kuli ndonga ya Chiebulaniya ulonzi wa “Lwimbo Lunojile” nawali ndo nzila yinji ya kulonga lwimbo lutogoligwe hali nzimbo zeng'ha, kota vila ulonzi ulingulonga “Mndewa wa wandewa” uwele nawali na mana ya mndewa yawele na ludali hali wandewa weng'ha. Chitabu changwaluka kwa kulonga kuwala itagwa lya mndewa Solomoni (Lwimbo Lunojile 1:1), ila mbuli ayi hailingutawiza kota heye ndo nakandika chitabu achi. Yanguweza kuwa chitabu achi nachandichigwa na munhu yunji yawele nakanuwila kumtogola mndewa Solomoni. Wasomile wa mbuli za chibibiliya hawalinguvizela chitabu achi nachandichigwa nili, ila yanguweza kuwa chitabu achi nachandichigwa kuli mhela wa ukomu wa mndewa Solomoni, hagati ha miyaka miya tisa na makumi saba (970) na miyaka miya tisa na makumi gadatu na umwe (931), Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa na nachiwichigwa goya kuli mhela wunji.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lwimbo Lunojile ndo chitabu chimemile lutogo lwa igano hali mlume na mdala. Mgati mwa chitabu achi, chila yumwe, mlume na mdala, kangumsimila mganwa wa heye kuwala maya goyawele nago kwa myage. Kuli mihela jimwenga kuli kusimila, goloko wa msongolo na wala goloko wa mhinza wangulavya ulonzi ulinguwadita welumbe na mnvina za igano (Lwimbo Lunojile 1:8). Wasomile wenji wangukunda kota mbuli itanganiche ya chitabu achi yangoneka kuli sula ya 8:5-7. Kuli misitali ajo mhinza kangulonga kota “Igano lina mong'ho kota kubagama.” Igano ndo chinhu chiwele na mong'ho ng'hatu na hachiweza kulemezigwa, kota vila kubagama. Hanji achi ndo chiwalo mhinza kangukanya mala zidatu kota wanhu waleche kulidita igano lyaluche kung'hali mhela wake kufika (Lwimbo Lunojile 2:7, 3:5, 8:4).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Kuli sula ya 1:1 chitabu changupegwa itagwa.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Lwimbo lwa mwaluko lwangupegwa itagwa kuli sula ya 1:2-2:7.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Lwimbo lwa keli lwa kuli sula 2:8-3:5.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Lwimbo lwa kadatu lwa kuli sula ya 3:6-5:1.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Lwimbo lwa kane lwa kuli sula ya 5:2-6:3.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Lwimbo lwa kahano lwa kuli sula ya 6:4-8:4.</para>
  <para style="io">7. Kuli kuduma, lwimbo lwa sita lwa kuli sula ya 8:5-8:14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Lwimbo lunojile kusinda nzimbo zeng'ha za Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 1:1">Shaili lya mwaluko</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:1">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />Unonele heni kwa mlomo wa hegwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">Igano lya hegwe lyangusangalaza heni kusinda divai.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />Unhunyhililo wa hegwe wangunhunyhilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">na itagwa lya hegwe ndo kota unhunyhililo ujidigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">acho ndo chiwalo cha wadala kukugana.<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />Udite himahima mndewa wa heni! Tudite himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Unyhiliche kuli chihengo cha hegwe.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:4">Goloko wa mhinza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Twangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha hegwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Twangulitogola igano lya hegwe kusinda divai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:4">Mhinza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Wahinza wa Yelusalemu, inoga wone momtogola.<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />Hemwe wahinza wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">ngozi ya heni ndo nhitu, ila yangunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">ndo nhitu kota mihema ja Kedali, kota mipaziya ja ihema lya Solomoni.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Mleche kunhogolela meho kwa vila ngozi ya heni ndo nhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">naiwa nhitu kwa chiwalo cha isanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Wang'holozangu nawanzudila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">na kundita ndiwe ndikola mijito kuli migunda ja mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">ahyo, siwele na mhela wa kuhega kwa chiwalo cha lukuli lwa heni.<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />Ndonjele gwa yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">kohi kodimila ming'holo ja hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">na kohi kojidita ming'holo ja hegwe jesele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Ndonjele kwa vila silingugana kulubaluba kota mng'hondwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">habehi na vilundo vya ming'holo vya goloko wa hegwe?</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:7">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />Gwa mdala unojile kusinda weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">wone hauvizelele udite hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">uwinze uzayo wa ming'holo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">na kuhilika mhene za hegwe kuli honhu ha kudila migongolo habehi na mihema ja wadimi.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />Mganwa wa heni, kunoga kwa hegwe ndo kota yumwe hali falasi wa chiundewa wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">yula yawopigwe kuli umwe hali mituka ja ngondo.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />Mizeze ja hegwe jangunojeza hojiwa na vinoligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">na singo ya hegwe hoiwa na ugasi wa maganga ga sendi nyinji.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />Tokugongomanyila ugasi wa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">uwele wonoligwa kwa sendi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:11">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />Mhela mndewa loyawele kuli ikochi lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">unhunyhililo wa heni nawenela chila honhu.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />Yondilingukugana, hegwe ndo kota unhunyhililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">ulinguwasa hagati ha matombo ga heni.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />Kwa heni ndo kota chizabala cha uluwa wa hina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">kulawa kuli migunda ja mizabibu ja Eni-gedi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:14">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />Ulole vyouwele unojile, gwa yondilingukugana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">Ulole vyouwele unojile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">Meho ga hegwe ndo kota ga ng'hunda.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:15">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />Ulole vyouwele unojile yondilingukugana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Ena, ulole vyounojile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Misolo midodi jowa ndo chinhanda cha hetwe.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 1:16">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />Migodi ja mielezi jowa ndo mizengo ja ng'handa ya hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">mibeloshi jowa ndo chinduwiko chake.<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="d">Mhinza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />Heni ndo kota uluwa wa Shaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">kota yunjiyunji lya kuli ibindi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 2:1">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />Hali wahinza wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">yondilingumgana ndo kota yunjiyunji hagati ha miwa.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 2:2">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />Heye yondilingumgana ndo kunoga kusinda wasongolo wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">heye ndo kota igodi lya mtufaa hali migodi ja kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">lubehelo lwake lwangungalila usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">ifuza lyake ndo linona lukami.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />Nakanyhola na kunyilika mbaka kuli chituka cha mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">nakangubika kwa igano lya heye.<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />Umhe heni mong'ho kwa zabibu zikalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">usangalaze heni kwa mafuza ga mtufaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">kwa vila nda ng'hochele kwa chiwalo cha igano.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />Moko wa heye wa kumoso wa hasi ha mutwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">moko wa heye wa kudilo wangung'humbatila.<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />Ndanguwadedeza hemwe wahinza wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">kota vyojiwele mibala na vifuno vya kisolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">Mleche kwambuza ne kwinula igano mbaka mhela wake houfika.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 2:7">Shaili lya keli</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 2:7">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />Uhulichize! Yondilingukugana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">Ulole! Ayu aha kanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">yozuma mchanya mwa vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">yobilima mchanya mwa vidunda vidodo.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />Yondilingumgana ndo kota ibala ama chifuno chisongolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">Ulole! Nakema habehi na lukanzi lwa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">yolola kukolela mitubuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">yosunjilila kukolela kuli ipaziya.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />Yondilingumgana nakandonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">“Winuche lelo, gwa yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">ulingunojeza, tulutase.<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />Ulole, mhela wa luhela umala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">nhonya naimala.<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />Uluwa naubahula chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">mhela wa kwimba ufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">lizi lya ng'hunda yanguhulikwa kuli migunda ja hetwe.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Mtini wangulavya mafuza gake ga mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">zabibu zilingubahula zangulavya kunhunyhilila kunojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">Uye lelo, gwa yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">uye tulutase.”</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 2:13">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />Gwa ng'hunda wa heni, wivisile kuli mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">wilajile ndikone kumeho kwa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">na kuhulika lizi lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">kwa vila lizi lya hegwe linoga na kumeho kwa hegwe kwangunojeza.<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />“Mtibatile mikanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">jila mikanhu midodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">jilinguwifya migunda ja mizabibu, migunda ja hetwe ja mizabibu jilingubahula.”</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 2:15">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />Yondilingumgana ndo wa heni, nani ndo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">kangunonela heni kota mdimi yalinguhilika migongolo ja heye hagati ha yunjiyunji.<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />Mbaka isanya holilawa na lubehelo holibilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">uhiluche yondilingukugana, uwe kota ibala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">ama kota chifuno chisongolo mchanya mwa vidunda vidodo vya Beteli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">vidunda vidodo vya Beteli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya, hanji ulonzi awu una mana ya vidunda vigawanuche. </char></note>.<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="d">Mhinza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />Nechilo yeng'ha lombele mchinhanda mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">nandimpala yondilingumgana mnhumbula mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">nandimpala ila simpatile.<verse eid="SNG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />Nanyinuka na kulubaluba mujini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">mnzila mbaka kuli honhu ha kiting'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">nandimpala yula yondilingumgana mnhumbula mwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">Nandimpala ila simpatile.<verse eid="SNG 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />Walingwamila muji nawafika heni lowawele wouzunguluta muji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">Nandiwauza, “Nammona yondilingumgana mnhumbula mwa heni?”<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />Mhela uchefu hela lotilechile na walingwamila muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">nandimona yula yondilingumgana mnhumbula mwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">Nandimibata, simlechile yoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">mbaka londimhiliche kaye kwa mamo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">mbaka kuli chihengo cha yula yamhondile.<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />Wahinza wa Yelusalemu ndanguwadedeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">kwa ibala na kwa chifuno cha kuli mgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">mleche kwambuza ne kwinula igano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">mbaka mhela wake houfika.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 3:5">Shaili lya kadatu</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 3:5">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />Ndo chinhu chachi chila chilingulawa kugunuche</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">kota ilingo lya iyosi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">chilingunhunyilila manemane na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">unhunyhililo ulinguguzigwa na walingugula na kuguza vinhu?<verse eid="SNG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Ulole! Ndo Solomoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">yapapigwe mchanya mwa chigoda cha heye cha undewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">nakazungulutwa na wamizi makumi sita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">wazidahe wanojile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />Chila yumwe wa hewo yebatile ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">chila yumwe wa hewo ka yazidahe kwa kitowa ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">Chila yumwe wa hewo kana ipanga lya heye mmoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">wewichile goya kitowa na mng'honyo nechilo.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Chigoda cha kumpichila Mndewa Solomoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:9">nachigongomanyigwa kwa mbawo zinojile kulawa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />Mizengo jake najigongomanyigwa kwa sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">chikalilo chake kwa zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">Honhu ha kikalisa nahagubikwa kwa chibende cha lanji ya zambalau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">chihonigwe kwa igano na wahinza wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Muye lelo hemwe wahinza wa muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">mumone mndewa Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">Nakavala kofia ya chiundewa yavalizwe na mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">zuwa lya mnvina ya heye ya kuhesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">ena, zuwa liwele nhumbula ya heye nayali imemile usangalalo.<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="d">Msongolo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />Ulole vyouwele unojile gwa yondilingukugana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Ena, ndaze vyouwele unojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Meho ga hegwe kumbele kwa shela ya hegwe ndo kota ga ng'hunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Mnvili za hegwe ndo kota mhene zilingudulika kulawa kuli chidunda cha Gileadi.<verse eid="SNG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />Mizino ja hegwe ndo mizelu kota ming'holo jitemigwe milaika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">jilingulawa koga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">Mizino ja hegwe najenela kuli mlomo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">haduhu ne izino liwele nalyuka.<verse eid="SNG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />Mlomo wa hegwe ndo kota uzi udung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">kumlomo kwa hegwe kwangunojeza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">Mizeze ja hegwe kumbele kwa shela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">ndo kota vihande vili vya ikomamanga.<verse eid="SNG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />Singo ya hegwe ndo kota ilingo lya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">liwele nalinoligwa kwa misitali ja maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">mchanya mwake naziwichigwa ngawo elufu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">zeng'ha ndo ngawo za wazidahe.<verse eid="SNG 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />Matombo ga hegwe ndo kota mibala minyambili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">kota mibala myana minyambili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">jilingulya hagati mwa yunjiyunji.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Ndochikala kuli vidunda vila vya manemane na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">mbaka hokubwemwenzuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">na jiza kwajilila.<verse eid="SNG 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />Hegwe kwa unojile kweng'ha, gwa yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">kwahela nongwa mgati mwa hegwe.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />Uye tulutase gwa yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">tulutase kulawa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">uduliche kulawa kuli chidunda cha Amana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kulawa mchanya mwa Senili, kuli chinhembenhembe cha Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kulawa kuli mhalika za misimba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kuli vidunda vya iduma.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />Nakuisangalaza nhumbula ya heni, gwa yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">nakuisangalaza nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">kwa kundola kamwe hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">na kwa honhu hado ha ugasi wa hegwe kuli singo ya hegwe.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />Ulole igano lya hegwe vyolilingusangalaza heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">yalinguhesigwa wa heni yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">igano lya hegwe lyangusangalaza kusinda divai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">na kunhunyhilila koneche!<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />Gwa yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">mlomo wa hegwe wangulagaza hanombwa kota ilala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">umyango wa hegwe una hanombwa na itombo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">Unhunyhililo unojile wa nguwo za hegwe ndo kota wula wa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />Hegwe ndo kagunda kevisile, yalinguhesigwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">hegwe ndo mwaluko wa mazi ulingulolelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">nzasa ya heni ndiliyeka.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />Mizuchila ja hegwe ndo kagunda ka makomamanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">gawele na mafuza ganojile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">kawele na hina na nalido.<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />Nalido na zafalani na misombasomba na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">hamwe na chila nhanzi ya igodi lya ubani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">na manemane na udi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">na chila nhanzi ya unhunyhililo unojile.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />Hegwe ndo nzasa ya kagunda ka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">ideho lya mazi galinguchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">galinguchililika kulawa Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 4:15">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />Winuche, gwa mbeho ya kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">uye gwa mbeho ya kusini!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Upute mchanya mwa kagunda ka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">leka unhunyhililo wa heye unojile wenele mbaka kumwambu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Yondilingumgana yoye kuli kagunda ka heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">na kujeza mafuza ganojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="d">Msongolo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />Nambuya kuli kagunda ka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">yalinguhesigwa wa heni yondikuganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nang'hungajiza manemane ga heni hamwe na unhunyhililo wunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nandilya ilala lya heni na hanombwa ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nanyinwa divai ya heni na itombo lya heni.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 5:1">Goloko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Goloko wa hetwe, mulye na munwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Migute kwa igano!</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 5:1">Shaili lya kane</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 5:1">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />Nambasa ila nhumbula ya heni haiwasile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Lizi lya yondilingumgana lyanguhodiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">“Nyumulile, yalinguhesigwa wa heni yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">ng'hunda ya heni yalihela nongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Mutwi wa heni naudoda kwa nungwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">na mnvili za heni kwa upesi wa nechilo.”<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />Navula ikanzu lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">ndaze vale kahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">Nanyovuga magulu ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">ndaze ndiwiche kahi kuli wavu?<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />Aho yondilingumgana nakadoliza lwizi, nhumbula ya heni naimema usangalalo.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />Nanyinuka kumchumulila yondilingumgana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">Kuno moko ga heni golagaza manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">vidole vya heni navilagaza unhunyhililo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">londibatile mhajilo kuchumula lwizi.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />Nandimchumulila lwizi yondilingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">ila nayali yochile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nhumbula ya heni naitweguka kwa kuka kwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nandimpala ila simonile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nandimchema ila hedichile.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Wamizi wa muji nawambona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">lowawele wokwamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">Nawanhowa na kundumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">nawasukula ikanzu lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">wala wamizi wa ng'hanzi.<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />Hemwe wadala wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">lommona yondilingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">mumlonjele kota ndangutamika kwa chiwalo cha igano.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 5:8">Goloko<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />Gwa ulingunojeza kusinda wadala weng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">Hambi ayo ulingumgana kana choni mzidi wa yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">mbaka utudedeze ahyo?</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 5:9">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />Yondilingumgana ndo yanojile na kana mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">yazidahe kusinda walume elufu kumi.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />Mutwi wa heye ndo unoga kota zahabu inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">mnvili za heye ndo kota misolo jibiniche, nhitu kota ibondwa.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />Meho ga heye ndo kota ng'hunda hafungo ha nzanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">ng'hunda iwele nzelu kota itombo, meho gawichigwe goya kota maganga ga sendi nyinji.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />Mizeze ja heye ndo kota mbuta za mgunda wa unhunyhililo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">Mlomo wa heye ndo kota yunjiyunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">ulingulagaza manemane.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />Moko ga heye ndo kota ng'hweku ya zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">inoligwe kwa maganga ga Talishishi ga sendi nyinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">Lukuli lwa heye ndo kota izino lya nhembo linoligwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">kwa maganga ga buluu galingupulika.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />Magulu ga heye gana mong'ho kota mizengo ja malimali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">jiwichigwe kuli zahabu inojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">Kumeho kwa heye ndo kota Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">nakunoga kota migodi jake ja mielezi.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />Mlomo wa heye naumema ulonzi unojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">kangunojeza lukami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Ayu ndo yondilingumgana, ena goloko wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">hemwe wadala wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="d">Goloko wa mhinza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />Gwa ulingunojeza kusinda wadala weng'ha, youlingumgana nakaluta kohi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Nakagaluchila nzila yachi, leka tumpale hamwe na hegwe?</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:1">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />Yondilingumgana nakaluta kuli kagunda ka heye, hali mbuta za uluwa ulingunhunyhilila goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">Kangudima ming'holo ja heye na kubawa yunjiyunji.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />Heni ndo wa heye yondilingumgana naye ndo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">ming'holo ja heye kangudimilaga hali yunjiyunji.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 6:3">Shaili lya kahano</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:3">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />Yondilingukugana, hegwe ndo unojile kota muji wa Tilisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">ulingunojeza kota muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">kwangububuwaza kota chilundo cha wamizi chiwele na bendela.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />Dedede, ulole hafungo, wone undole ndangusanzalima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">Mnvili za hegwe ndo kota chilundo cha mhene, zilingudulika kulawa kuli chidunda cha Gileadi.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />Mizino ja hegwe ndo mizelu kota ming'holo jilingulawa koga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">Najenela kuli mlomo wa hegwe, haduhuli liwele nalyuka.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />Mizeze ja hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">ndo kota nusu ya ikomamanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">kumbele kwa shela ya hegwe.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Wone hawe na wache wa wandewa makumi sita</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">na waha makumi nane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">na wohambe wating'hane na walume hawalinguwazika,<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />ila ng'hunda ya heni ndo ya chiuyeng'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">na yahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">mhinza wa udewele kwa mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">yalinguganigwa na yampondile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Wahinza wangumlolaga na kumchema yawele yatambichizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">wache wa wandewa na waha nawamtogola.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:9">Goloko<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />Whaani ayo yalinguya kota kubwemwenzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">yanojile kota nyelezi na yalingulangaza kota isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">kangububuwaza kota chilundo cha wamizi wawele na bendela?</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:10">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />Nanyinjila kuli kagunda ka milozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kulola mizuchila ja kuli ibindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kona kota mizabibu najikula ama mikomamanga najibahula.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />Ne kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">maya ga heni ga kuwa na hegwe nagandita heni mbubuwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">kota nda hagati ha mituka ja chiundewa jilingukwejigwa na falasi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:12">Goloko<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 6:13" />Uhiluche, uhiluche, gwa Mshulami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">uhiluche, uhiluche leka tukulole!</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 6:13">Msongolo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Lekachoni mwangumlola Mshulami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">kota mwanguwalola wanhu walinguvina ngoma ya Mahanaimu?<verse eid="SNG 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />Gwa mhinza wa mwana wa mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">ulole ndaze magulu ga hegwe vyogalingunojeza kuli makwamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Mahaza ga hegwe ndo kota maganga ga sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">gawele nagahongoligwa na muwanzi yanojile.<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />Ikuvu lya hegwe ndo kota chizombe chinoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">chiwele changuwaga na divai inojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">Munda wa hegwe ndo kota chilundo cha ngano chizungulutwe kwa yunjiyunji.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />Matombo ga hegwe ndo kota mibala minyambili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">vifuno vinyambili.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />Singo ya hegwe ndo kota ilingo lya izino lya itembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">Meho ga hegwe ndo kota milamba ja Heshiboni, habehi na lwizi lwa Beti-labi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">Mhenyelo ya hegwe ndo kota ilingo lya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">lilingulola kulutila Damasiko.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />Mutwi wa hegwe ndo kota chidunda cha Kalimeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">Mnvili za hegwe ndo nhitu na zangupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">kunoga kwa hegwe kwanguweza kumibata munhu yoneche mbaka mndewa.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />Ulole vyouwele unojile na wa kunojeza, gwa yondilingukugana ulingunojeza!<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />Koneka kwa hegwe ndo ng'wemang'wema kota mnazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">matombo ga hegwe ndo kota vizabala vya mafuza.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />Nandonga, “Ndokwina kuli mnazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">ndobawa nazi zake.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">Matombo gako ndo kota vizabala vya zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">kunhunyhilila kwa lweselo lwa hegwe ndo kota tufaa,<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />mlomo wa hegwe ndo kota divai inojile.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 7:9">Mhinza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">Lelo, divai ilute mbaka kwa yondilingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">ichililike mholemhole mchanya mwa mlomo na mizino ja heye.<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />Heni ndo wa heye yondilingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">naye kana maya kwa heni.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />Gwa yondilingukugana, uye tulute kuli migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">tukawase ako kuli vijiji.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />Lelo, tulute lufuku kuli migunda ja mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">leka tone kota mizabibu najaluka kuzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">kota uluwa wake nawaluka kubahula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">na kota mikomamanga najilavya uluwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">Ako ndokupa igano lya heni.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Unhunyhililo wa mituletule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mituletule </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo ifuza liwele hewo wangutumbila kota wone mdala yolya ifuza alyo lyomwambuza kuponda lukami.</char></note> naumema kuli ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">habehi na lwizi lwa hetwe hana chila nhanzi ya mafuza ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">ga katali na ga sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">gawele nandikuwichila hegwe yondilingukugana.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />Wone wahawele kalumbu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">yawele nakong'ha matombo ga mayangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">Hamba, wone ndahakufichile ako kunze, ndahakunonele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">na haduhu yoneche yawele yahambezile.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />Ndahakuholile na kukuhilika kuli ng'handa ya mayangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">yawele nakandangusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">Ndahakupele divai ing'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">kulawa kuli makomamanga ga heni.<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />Moko wa hegwe wa kumoso wa hasi ha mutwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">moko wa hegwe wa kudilo wangung'humbatila.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Wahinza wa Yelusalemu ndanguwadedeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">mleche kwambuza ne kwinula igano mbaka mhela wake houfika.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 8:4">Shaili lya sita</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:4">Goloko<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />Whaani ayu yalinguya kulawa kuli chiwala kuno yomwegamila yalingumgana?</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:5">Mhinza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">Nandikwinula hasi ha mtufaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">hala hawele mayako nakona usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">ena, hala hawele mayako nakakuponda.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />Mbiche kota mhuli mnhumbula mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">kota mhuli kuli moko wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">kwa vila igano lina mong'ho kota kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">lina fihi ing'hang'hale kota isi ya wabagame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Lyangulakaza kota ilapi lya chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">kota ilapi likulu lya chiluli.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Mazi menji hagoweza kuzimya igano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">mazi tendema hagoweza kulyusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Wone munhu yahalavile sendi za heye zeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha igano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">yahabezigwe ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:7">Goloko<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />Twanaye lumbu mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">matombo ga heye gang'hali kutona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Lelo, todita choni kwa ayu lumbu wa hetwe hoyowa yobanichilwa?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />Wone yahawele lukanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">twahamzenjele ilingo lya sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">wone kahi yahawele lwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">twahamzungulusile kwa mbawo za mielezi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:9">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />Hamwande mhambaga ya heni nayali kota lukanzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">ila sambi, matombo ga heni ndo kota milingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">ahyo, nda kota yalingumgalila kikala goya.<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Solomoni nayali na mgunda wa mizabibu ako Baali-hamoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">nakawabasila walimi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">Chila yumwe wa hewo nakalipa migwala elufu imwe ja sendi kuli chila mwaka.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />Ila lukuli lwa heni ndo kota mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">na ndangukupa hegwe Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">Haulinguganigwa kumha heni migwala elufu imwe ja sendi kwa chiwalo cha mafuza ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">ila ndowapa migwala miya mbili ja sendi wala walingundolela.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:12">Msongolo<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />Hegwe ulingikala kuli kagunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">goloko wa heni wangubeteza kuhulika lizi lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">ahyo, ndangugana ng'hatu kuhulika lizi lya hegwe.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="SNG 8:13">Mhinza<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />Uye himahima gwa yondilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">uwe kota ibala ama chifuno chisongolo mchanya mwa chidunda cha unhunyhililo.<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>